      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 37 Swifthall to the market, a superb two-bedroom, second floor apartment ideally positioned within the highly regarded Collegewood development in Castleknock. The development is renowned for its attractive landscaped communal gardens and family friendly atmosphere, complete with a children's playground and a montessori. Everything Castleknock Village has to offer is within easy walking distance, accessed in c. 10 minutes via a convenient pedestrian walkway at the rear of the development. Castleknock offers a wide range of cafés, restaurants, boutique shops, schools, and leisure facilities. The magnificent Phoenix Park, one of Europe's largest enclosed city parks, is also close by, offering extensive walking and cycling trails, sports facilities, and open green spaces. The area is exceptionally well served by public transport, with bus routes just a short walk away and Castleknock Train Station nearby, providing regular services to Dublin City Centre. For motorists, the M50 is easily accessible, ensuring straightforward connections to Dublin Airport, the city centre, and the wider motorway network.\n\nThis superb apartment offers bright, open, and spacious living accommodation extending to approximately 71 sq m. The accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with hot press/storage closet, two generously proportioned double bedrooms (one with ensuite), a main family bathroom, and a fully fitted modern kitchen with an open plan living/dining area. Externally, the property boasts a private balcony overlooking the fields providing a private and sunny outdoor space.\n\nPresented in great condition and ready for immediate occupancy, No. 37  is sure to appeal to both first-time buyers and investors alike. The property further benefits from a B BER rating qualifying of a green mortgage, lift and stairs access, gas fired central heating, built in wardrobes, a private balcony and a chain free sale for a quick turnaround.\n\nFeatures;\n c.71 sq m\n 2 BED/ 2 BATH\n BER B qualifying of a green mortgage\n Gas fired central heating\n Lift and stairs access\n Designated parking\n Built in 2005\n Management fee c.2,900 p/a\n Spacious double bedrooms\n Situated in a prime location in Castleknock\n Ready for immediate occupancy\n Castleknock Train Station and Castleknock Village within minutes\n Private balcony not overlooked\n Public transport links & schools in close proximity\n Mature, sought after development\n Viewing is highly advised!\n\nDirections:\n\nEircode = D15KR67\n\nWhen driving into the Collegewood development, drive past the montessori and keep going straight. Take the first left turn and the main door 'Swifthall  24-46' is where you enter. No. 37 is on the 2nd floor via stairs or lift."
      },
      {
